  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Afghanistan Emergency National Solidarity Project II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&quot;Building on the current NSPcomma the NSP II will scale up the program to &quot;&quot;lay the foundations for strengthening of community level governancecomma and to support community-managed subprojects comprising reconstruction and development that improve access of rural communities to social and productive infrastructure and services.&quot;&quot;    Reaching out to an estimated additional 4comma318 new villagescomma the NSP II will (i) establish a framework for village level consultative decision making and representative local leadership as a basis for interaction within and between communities on the one handcomma and with the administration and aid agencies on the othercomma (ii) implement social and economic productive activities addressing the basic village needscomma and (iii) develop human capital and livelihood which will improve household welfare.&quot;</narrative>
  </description>
